   "title": "About the model",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## About LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.5\n\nMeituan's audio-driven avatar model (MIT licence), built on LongCat-Video. It runs here through **kijai/ComfyUI-WanVideoWrapper**; ComfyUI has no native LongCat video nodes.\n\nIt generates **93-frame windows at 25 fps** (3.7 s). Long videos are **video continuation**: each window opens on the last 13 frames of the one before and adds 80 new frames.\n\n**No end frame.** Conditioning frames always sit at the start of a window. The two experimental workflows use the one lever there is: the position of the identity reference inside the window.\n\nModel card: https://huggingface.co/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.5"
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    660,
    1920
   ],
   "size": [
