   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 3",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 3. Chunk plan\n\nThe voiceover is cut into **windows of 93 frames** (3.72 s at 25 fps). Chunk 1 keeps all 93; every later chunk keeps **80 new frames** after a 13-frame lead-in taken from the chunk before, so motion runs straight through every join.\n\n**Each run renders the next unfinished chunk**, found from the files on disk. There is no counter to reset: a new voiceover starts at chunk 1 in its own folder, and an interrupted render continues where it stopped. Chunks must render **in order**.\n\n**anchor: end image** (experimental): identity for every chunk but the last, whose final frame is pulled toward the End Image. A video shorter than one window is split in two so the end image can apply. You can switch the anchor here on any workflow; use a new `name_suffix` when you do.\n\nWhisper gets the window's audio plus 2 s either side, after the whole track is normalised to -23 LUFS, so loudness never jumps between chunks."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    2640,
    1870
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    520
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 5,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 4",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 4. Models - loaded automatically\n\nNothing to set here. Setup downloads every file on first boot (Kijai/WanVideo_comfy).\n\n- **LongCat-Avatar 1.5**, bf16 (LongCat only runs at bf16 base precision), with the **DMD distill LoRA**: 8 steps, cfg 1.\n- **v1.5 Distill Sigmas** reproduces the upstream 8-step schedule. WanVideoWrapper's `longcat_distill_euler` is the v1.0 schedule.\n- **umt5-xxl** text encoder, **Wan 2.1 VAE**, **Whisper large-v3** audio encoder.\n\n**Less than 80 GB of VRAM?** Select **Block Swap** and press Ctrl+B to enable it (20 of 48 blocks), and/or set the model loader's `quantization` to `fp8_e4m3fn`. Attention is `sdpa`; `sageattn` works if SageAttention 2 is installed (1.0.6 does not)."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    3300,
    2170
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    380
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 6,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 5",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 5. Portrait, opening and audio guidance\n\n- The portrait is cropped to the canvas and encoded once.\n- **Opening + Reference** gives chunk 1 the portrait as its single opening frame. Later chunks get the previous chunk's last 13 frames, re-encoded (the v1.5 way), plus a reference latent.\n- **Whisper Embeds** turns the window's audio into lip-sync features; **Extend Embeds** combines them with the opening, the reference and its position.\n\nNothing to set here."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    3960,
    760
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    260
   ],
   "flags": {},
