   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 6",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 6. Sampling + decode\n\nFixed seed, 8 steps, cfg 1 and audio cfg 1, as upstream runs the distilled v1.5 model. Nothing to set here.\n\nOut of memory? Enable Block Swap (stage 4), turn on `enable_vae_tiling` on the decode node, or use the Fast (640) workflow."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    4620,
    550
   ],
   "size": [
    520,
    400
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 8,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "title": "About stage 7",
   "widgets_values": [
    "## 7. Save + stitch\n\nEach chunk is saved to `output/longcat_longform/<name>/chunk_0000.mp4`, ... as it finishes, so you can check one early.\n\nThe final video is saved as `output/<audio name><suffix>.mp4`, stitched with your **original** audio track.\n\n**Resume:** run again; finished chunks are skipped. **Redo from a chunk:** delete that chunk's file **and every later one**, then run; each chunk continues from the one before it. **Render a finished video again:** change `name_suffix`, or delete its folder under `output/longcat_longform/`."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
